1. What VRYOH Is

VRYOH Intelligence is a B2B review-response and guest-signal-detection platform for hospitality and F&B operators. It runs guest reviews through an AI pipeline that detects and interprets emotional and operational signals — including signals masked behind polite language — and produces governed, human-approved response drafts plus structured intelligence reports.

