5. Competitive Positioning

Birdeye (birdeye.com) is the confirmed closest named competitor. Checked directly against Birdeye's Review Insights product page (birdeye.com/review-reports):

Birdeye's Review Insights product operates on aggregate sentiment, volume, and trend analysis across locations — reputation scoring, competitive benchmarking, response-time/rate tracking, AI-generated summaries of "hundreds of reviews," and shareable dashboards.
It is explicitly prescriptive — marketed around "actionable nudges" and "AI-powered recommendations that strengthen your online reputation and keep you ahead of the competition."

This is a useful, direct contrast rather than a threat to VRYOH's differentiation: VRYOH operates at the individual-review, masked-signal level and is architecturally non-prescriptive (detect and interpret only, human approves every action). Neither of those two things appears in Birdeye's public Review Insights material.

